  "id": "82196d221b82b1b664f9dc8447ed3c21",
  "name": {
   "zh": "动作中间帧 · Two-stage Transformer",
   "en": "Motion Inbetween · Two-stage Transformer"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "两阶段的动作补帧框架：给一些上下文帧和一个目标帧，非自回归地生成长度可变的过渡动作，先由 Context Transformer 出粗略过渡，再由 Detail Transformer 精修动作细节。这张卡从导入角色的关键帧补出中间动作；可以原样交付这个角色，也可以在「目标角色」里选导入的 FBX / USD 角色重定目标过去，交付 USD。",
   "en": "A two-stage motion inbetweening framework: given some context frames and a target frame, it non-autoregressively generates a transition of variable length, first a rough transition from the Context Transformer, then detail refined by the Detail Transformer. This card fills in the motion between the imported character's keyframes; you can deliver that character as is, or retarget to an imported FBX / USD character chosen in Target Character, delivered as USD."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-12T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "motion_gen",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
